- TransferManager
- TransferEndpoint framework
- Link graph
- routing engine
- congestion model
- packet model
- protocol overhead model
- latency engine
- shared-resource scheduler

The current requirement is only:

source endpoint capacity
+
destination endpoint capacity
→ effective bytes per second


